--TEST--
a `match` over an enum that misses a case is an error that starts at the `match` keyword
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Size { Small, Large }
Size $s = Size::Small;
string $label = match ($s) {
    Size::Small => "small",
};
echo $label;
--REQUEST--
diagnostics
--EXPECT--
2:20-2:25 hint - an enum case `Size::Large` is not used anywhere in this workspace
4:17-4:22 error E1016 this `match` does not handle `Size::Large`
